--TEST--
a method's own declaration answers itself and every call that resolves to it, which is the same list a cursor on one of those calls answers and is the point of spelling both readings of a cursor in one place, `rule:ide/five-features-are-one-reference-index`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class User
{
    public function gr<|>eet(): string
    {
        return "hi";
    }
}

var $u = new User();
echo $u->greet();
echo $u->greet();
--REQUEST--
references
--EXPECT--
case.nvs:4:21
case.nvs:11:10
case.nvs:12:10
